ut players together as often  as possible seamless co-op campaign  populating hubs like the Citadel maybe  PvP bounties the more human control  characters in the world the more that  world comes to life games like destiny  are already doing a great job at this  concept whether mass effect 4 ends up as  an expanded co-op encounter or an online  multi-player shooter player interaction  is where it's at well that's it for our  top 5 list did you spend any time in  Mass Effect 3's multiplayer getting your  whips on some people in our office never  even touched it did you go fill out  Bioware survey on what you want the next  Mass Effect to be leave your thoughts in  the comments below and hey fire up the  old massive entry multi-player you might  find yourself shoulder to shoulder with  a smelly Batarian and loving it

